  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">mHealth ger medicinska r&#xe5;dgivning &#xf6;ver telefon. De har ett n&#xe4;tverk av licensierade l&#xe4;kare som ger konsultationer mobilt och har &#xe4;ven koppling till apotek och v&#xe5;rdcentraler f&#xf6;r uppf&#xf6;ljning. Aff&#xe4;rsmodellen byggs via medlemskap som k&#xf6;ps i from av &quot;scratch       cards&quot;. Avtalspart &#xe4;r mHealth Ventures India Pvt Ltd [MVI], org.nr U85100MH2010PTC211276, Indien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">mHealth provide affordable, timly, highly qualified consultations with licensed doctors over the phone. Links with local health         centres,pharmacies and follow-ups are an integral part of their model. Agreement partner is mHealth Ventures India Pvt Ltd [MVI], org reg no U85100MH2010PTC211276, Ind&#xed;a.</narrative>
  </description>
